   "header": "<h2> Changes the workflow to use precise data </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»smile« puts your manufacturing on a reliable foundation of exact tool measurement data. This workflow provides the best starting conditions you can offer your CNC machines.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/smile420-pilot40-de\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy Now</a> <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 Expert Consultation</a></p>",
