  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Ergonomics at Your Fingertips </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The »eQ« (ergonomic &amp; quick) one-hand control handle allows you to adjust the entire machine tower along the X-axis and Z-axis with just one hand. Additionally, additional functions can be assigned to the »eQ’s« trigger button. This makes operation even more convenient and ergonomic.</p>",
