  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Designed for High Precision </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">The SK 50 spindle accommodates adapters with SK 50 mounts. Thanks to its especially precise features, it delivers precise results with every measurement. It features radial run-out accuracy of &lt; 2 µm, a pneumatic spindle brake, 4 x 90° spindle indexing, and integrated calibration balls.</p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/b/csm_smile_hohe_praezision_9efb62c372.webp",
