  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Built for Manufacturing </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">Everything about »smile« is designed for durability and continuous use. Whether in large-scale production, a medium-sized operation, or a small manufacturing operation—this presetting and measuring machine keeps pace with your production cycle. Even right next to the CNC machine. </p>",
