  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Boost the Efficiency of Your Manufacturing Operations </h2>",
   "body": "<p>»smile« will reduce your manufacturing costs and increase the uptime of your machines and tools. It’s a smart investment that pays for itself quickly.<br/><br/><strong>Take advantage of our online starter package</strong>, <strong>»smile 420 / pilot 4.0«</strong><br/><strong>»,« today</strong>. <a class=\"btn\" href=\"https://myzoller.com/de/de/shop/smile420-pilot40-de\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Buy now</a></p>",
